		description="U.S.P.S. (undead summoned postal service) project 📬
Hermes, the messenger, found that managing the hundreds of mailpieces that come in daily was getting tough, so he set up a new postal service and put up some job listings in the land of the dead to get some help.

The story follows Maia, who is new to the world of the living and uses her new Job to explore places and eat foods she hasn't before, while navigating a new life in an unfamiliar place. 
